{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience The Last Case of Benedict Fox: Definitive Edition, featuring reimagined combat and traversal that is both intense and exhilarating. Paired with new lightning-fast animations and a substantially upgraded AI, topped by terrifying secrets and new stories\u00a0to discover filled with brand-new puzzles, brace yourself for a thrill that will send shivers down your spine!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2023360/extras/1eda4aa009475adf5fc5fbd828bbbe69.poster.avif?t=1737367162\" width=600 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2023360/extras/1eda4aa009475adf5fc5fbd828bbbe69.webm?t=1737367162\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2023360/extras/1eda4aa009475adf5fc5fbd828bbbe69.mp4?t=1737367162\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend into a limbo of decaying memories as Benedict Fox, a self-proclaimed detective bound to his demon companion. Use that unholy bond to explore the minds of the recently deceased in search of clues as you uncover the mysteries of a massive, decrepit mansion \u2014 the site to a young couple's grisly murder, and the disappearance of their child. Immerse yourself in a dark, intriguing world full of secret organizations, forbidden rituals, and cold-blooded crimes in an arcane adventure brought to life through a fascinating Burton-esque art style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2023360/extras/c3204002f6a7f83eb018ab81267cfd22.avif?t=1737367162\" width=600 height=166 /></span>Fight demons, explore the subconscious, and solve elaborate puzzles in a labyrinthian adventure inspired by Lovecraft's nightmares, noir pulp fiction, and early 20th-century jazz music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2023360/extras/9c30e424d7a8fe5a0076b592690f135a.poster.avif?t=1737367162\" width=600 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2023360/extras/9c30e424d7a8fe5a0076b592690f135a.webm?t=1737367162\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2023360/extras/9c30e424d7a8fe5a0076b592690f135a.mp4?t=1737367162\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2023360/extras/bb22a2ec1727b97dc0edcc81857e1987.avif?t=1737367162\" width=600 height=166 /></span>Use your bond with the demon to explore the minds of the recently deceased in your last chance to get a \u201ctestimony\u201d. Jump into surreal worlds where memories, emotions, and traumas take on a physical form.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2023360/extras/83d9c98b36aa573e5a703c3fdd041bfc.poster.avif?t=1737367162\" width=600 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2023360/extras/83d9c98b36aa573e5a703c3fdd041bfc.webm?t=1737367162\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2023360/extras/83d9c98b36aa573e5a703c3fdd041bfc.mp4?t=1737367162\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2023360/extras/b6ed9d9f047f3c9ecdcf92deb4a451eb.avif?t=1737367162\" width=600 height=166 /></span>Uncover the secrets of an old mansion where a couple has been found slain, and their child has gone missing. Get drawn into a dark, yet intimate intrigue that will have you face the family\u2019s demons - both figuratively and literally!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2023360/extras/440dcd5e28018a9b89f15d3af125ca34.poster.avif?t=1737367162\" width=600 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2023360/extras/440dcd5e28018a9b89f15d3af125ca34.webm?t=1737367162\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2023360/extras/440dcd5e28018a9b89f15d3af125ca34.mp4?t=1737367162\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2023360/extras/28419cf7955a903654692d5a9c845b80.avif?t=1737367162\" width=600 height=166 /></span>Use your weapons, demon powers, and surroundings in creative combinations to overcome demons, monsters, and cultists - but remember that concentration and a tactical approach are your greatest assets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2023360/extras/41804b1332d26b4ea9caecc720512736.poster.avif?t=1737367162\" width=600 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2023360/extras/41804b1332d26b4ea9caecc720512736.webm?t=1737367162\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2023360/extras/41804b1332d26b4ea9caecc720512736.mp4?t=1737367162\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Alone together.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2023360/134d27c9d8bc08fa55f9b6987b3fbd3dc4d24427.jpg"},{"name":"Cannonball!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2023360/84fa300d111455e1d8f1393df6a40b20d7e1cfd3.jpg"},{"name":"Can't catch me!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2023360/185ac20623a5205967cfb2663d55718bba41c2a5.jpg"},{"name":"Can't reach me!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2023360/f138fdfe11023af765715355d12a18969982a2cb.jpg"},{"name":"Curiosity killed the cat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2023360/01d9634a4a4e1eed1bdddea35af4c45685485db7.jpg"},{"name":"Damsel in distress.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2023360/1e53ee44859fd11d4ff2f68b13d31ebb77148c46.jpg"},{"name":"Descent into the Limbo","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2023360/c3731c59a20308a3dfa9663c9a878355af81926f.jpg"},{"name":"Everything is connected","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2023360/20cef492968c2cf67a1698d2169b97f0fa2c01ca.jpg"},{"name":"First of many","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2023360/0bc08d5e20f716d1f8091a8d075445393247ca62.jpg"},{"name":"Get inked!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2023360/12183be507dee791d15975ea5a073cc0c8f3b056.jpg"}],"total":32},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2023360?t=1737367162","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2023360/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1737367162","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2023360/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1737367162","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2023360/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1737367162","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience The Last Case of Benedict Fox: Definitive Edition, featuring reimagined combat and traversal that is both intense and exhilarating. Paired with new lightning-fast animations and a substantially upgraded AI, topped by terrifying secrets and new stories\u00a0to discover filled with brand-new puzzles, brace yourself for a thrill that will send shivers down your spine!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2023360/extras/1eda4aa009475adf5fc5fbd828bbbe69.poster.avif?t=1737367162\" width=600 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2023360/extras/1eda4aa009475adf5fc5fbd828bbbe69.webm?t=1737367162\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2023360/extras/1eda4aa009475adf5fc5fbd828bbbe69.mp4?t=1737367162\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend into a limbo of decaying memories as Benedict Fox, a self-proclaimed detective bound to his demon companion. Use that unholy bond to explore the minds of the recently deceased in search of clues as you uncover the mysteries of a massive, decrepit mansion \u2014 the site to a young couple's grisly mu